ment variables inherited from the calling program as well as those modified by the application itself will be passed to the shell. In light of the vulnerability in the shell bash described in CVE-2014-6271, the runtime environment should be reviewed to ensure that this is not an exploitable call.</span> <span>If this application is being run in an environment in which bash is present, ensure that the version of bash used always includes the most recent security updates. Also, in the application itself, consider creating an allowlist of environment variables to protect against external contamination.</span> <span>References: <a href=\"https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/454.html\">CWE</a> <a href=\"https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2014-6271\">CVE-2014-6271</a></span>"},"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"app/src/main/java/com/veracode/verademo/controller/ToolsController.java"},"region":{"startLine":53}},"logicalLocations":[{"name":"ping","fullyQualifiedName":"com.veracode.verademo.controller.ToolsController.ping","kind":"function"},{"fullyQualifiedName":"java.lang.Runtime.exec","kind":"member","parentIndex":0}]}],"ruleId":"454","partialFingerprints":{"flawHash":"1420778132","flawHashCount":"1","flawHashOrdinal":"1","causeHash":"265702587","causeHashCount":"1","causeHashOrdinal":"1","procedureHash":"2654727598","prototypeHash":"2923252499"}},{"level":"note","rank":0,"message":{"text":"<span>The program fails to release or incorrectly releases the variable br, which was previously allocated by a call to java.io.BufferedReader.!operator_javanewinit().</span> <span>Ensure that all code paths properly release this resource.</span> <span>References: <a href=\"https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/404.html\">CWE</a></span>"},"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"app/src/main/java/com/veracode/verademo/controller/ToolsController.java"},"region":{"startLine":58}},"logicalLocations":[{"name":"ping","fullyQua